@baseUrl = https://localhost:5104
@token = replace-with-access-token
@userId = replace-with-user-id

### Current user's cumulative counters, indicator and effective quota (also accessible at the limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resource-usage/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Latest snapshot per user (administrator role required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resource-usage/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consuming operation: returns 429 Problem Details when quota is exhausted
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Erase points for an exhausted user (administrator only; exempt from quota)
# ExpectedCredits = AppliedCredits + CreditBalance from the latest overview.
# Returns 409 for stale credits, a non-exhausted user or an amount above consumption.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resource-usage/admin/{{userId}}/erase
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": 100,
  "expectedCredits": 0
}

### Unknown target: 404 (administrator token required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/resource-usage/admin/missing-user/erase
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": 100,
  "expectedCredits": 0
}
